# ===================================================================
# Atom AI Assistant - Environment Configuration
# ===================================================================
# Atom operates securely via the server-side endpoint (/api/atom).
# When deployed to Vercel, set these in Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# If neither API key is provided, Atom operates with high accuracy using its
# built-in, verified deterministic profile matcher with zero external dependencies.

# Groq API Key (Recommended - Ultra-fast responses)
# Get a key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key (Alternative)
# Get a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# OpenAI API Key (Alternative)
# Get a key at: https://platform.openai.com/
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Note: NEVER prefix secret keys with VITE_ to prevent them from leaking into client bundles!
